  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "idl2wrs: Fix a check for a single bit set in a bitmap",
  "description": "The check (val & (val-1)) is intended to be nonzero for all cases\nother than where a single bit is set, but it doesn't correctly handle\nthe case where val is zero, which also ends up being zero. Zero isn't\na valid value for a bitmap value; one bit needs to be set. (Not that\n0 is used in the idl processed by this.)\n\nChecking for it also avoids a warning about overflow from Coverity.\nCoverity CID 1604196",
